{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_060910","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"法国也出了很多哲学家。笛卡尔、巴塔耶、萨特、鲍德里亚……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"萨特的话，我也知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"就是那个说“切·格瓦拉是20世纪最完美的人”的家伙吧？挺有眼光。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"萨特他……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"吓了一跳吧！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"才不是呢。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"萨特本来就是左翼的支持者嘛。除此之外，你还知道萨特什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"……不知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"什么都不知道？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"真是的，他可是<R= 存 在 主 义 ,EXISTENTIALISME>的大师……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 存 在 主 义 ,EXISTENTIALISME>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"<R= 出 口 主 义 ,EXITENTIALISME>吗？那我倒想听听。潜入时不先确保撤退路线，可是再危险不过……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 出 口 主 义 ,EXITENTIALISME>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"不是。是<R= 存 在 主 义 ,EXISTENTIALISME>。为什么里面还混进英语了？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 存 在 主 义 ,EXISTENTIALISME>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……抱歉，我对哲学没什么兴趣。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"是吗？我觉得哲学会让人生更丰富。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"与其思考“人应该怎样活”“人的本质是什么”之类的问题，不如直接行动更快。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"我就是这样一路活过来，才成了现在的我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"咦？这倒和萨特说的很像。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"是吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"嗯。他说人并没有与生俱来的本质，所谓自我，是由自己自由创造出来的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"自由？说得还真轻松。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"不是这个意思。正因为自由，所以才必须对自己负责。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"“人被判处自由之刑”……这是萨特说过的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"“自由之刑”吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"不过，他人的目光会试图把你固定成“你就是这样的人”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"这一点我最近可是深有体会。明明我都说了“叫我Snake”，他们就是不听。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"“地狱，就是他人”……这也是萨特说的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"地狱吗……不过，这里毕竟是<R=天国之外,OUTER HEAVEN>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=天国之外,OUTER HEAVEN>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}